# Experiment outputs (large, generated)
*.parquet
# ...except the committed market data. 956 KB for 27 assets is small enough to
# live in the repo as ordinary git objects, so `git clone` alone gives a
# working dataset — no Git LFS, no copying files out of a sibling project, no
# setup commands before `make start`. The sibling risk_premium_pca/ keeps its
# own LFS config; this directory deliberately does not use it.
!data/*.parquet
*.pkl
*.pickle
